	\L_00ecf:
	!VAR0516 : 1!
	\L_00e27:
	\L_00e0b:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　Thieves’ Hideout'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　Rance’s Room'
	\L_00ef8:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was sitting on his bed'
	R
	'with a sour face. He was'
	R
	'apparently in a really bad'
	R
	'mood.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	!VAR0516 : 3!
	\L_00e97:
	\L_00e43:
	ZH 1:
	'Did you call, Boss?'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e7b:
	ZH 1:
	'Bound casually walked in.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00dd3:
	ZH 1:
	'I did.'
	R
	'So there’s a problem.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e43:
	ZH 1:
	'What is it?'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00dd3:
	ZH 1:
	'Someone peeked in my and'
	R
	'Sill’s fun yesterday.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e43:
	ZH 1:
	'Geh...'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00dd3:
	ZH 1:
	'I only got a glimpse of him,'
	R
	'but he had red hair.'
	R
	'I’m seriously annoyed.'
	R
	'Find him and kill him.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e43:
	ZH 1:
	'Boss, that’s going a little'
	R
	'far... We could make it so he'
	R
	'can’t have sex anymore, but'
	R
	'taking his life is...'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00dd3:
	ZH 1:
	'Kill him.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e43:
	ZH 1:
	'...Okay, understood.'
	R
	'As soon as I find him...'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00dd3:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t be passive.'
	R
	'Men should always be proactive.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e43:
	ZH 1:
	'Okay, understood.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e5f:
	ZH 1:
	'The boss is so strict...'
	\L_00ef8:
	ZH 1:
	'Maybe that’s how you have to'
	R
	'be to stand above everyone'
	R
	'else, though...'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
	\L_00e7b:
	ZH 1:
	'While thinking some things'
	R
	'over, Bound left Rance’s room.'
	\L_00ef8:
	\L_00eeb:
